{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.882,"lines":[{"text":"Marco on the beat…","t":1.8,"e":3.04,"w":[["Marco",1.8,2.22],["on",2.42,2.5],["the",2.54,2.62],["beat",2.7,3.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Eh eh eh…","t":4.44,"e":5.77,"w":[["Eh",4.44,4.66],["eh",5.11,5.31],["eh",5.57,5.77]],"ok":0.33},{"text":"Na God do am o…","t":6.02,"e":6.62,"w":[["Na",6.02,6.1],["God",6.18,6.48],["do",6.49,6.69],["am",6.51,6.71],["o",6.52,6.62]],"ok":0.6},{"text":"C’est le Vieux Père qui gère hein…","t":7.5,"e":8.9,"w":[["C’est",7.5,7.58],["le",7.62,7.72],["Vieux",7.78,7.96],["Père",8.02,8.22],["qui",8.26,8.38],["gère",8.44,8.72],["hein",8.74,8.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Abidjan to Accra… Kumasi to Bouaké…","t":10.16,"e":13.76,"w":[["Abidjan",10.16,10.64],["to",10.7,10.86],["Accra",10.94,11.38],["Kumasi",12.48,12.96],["to",13.04,13.2],["Bouaké",13.26,13.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Yɛda Onyame ase! (Nous remercions Dieu)","t":14.66,"e":18.18,"w":[["Yɛda",14.66,14.86],["Onyame",15.56,16.4],["ase",16.8,17.0],["Nous",17.19,17.39],["remercions",17.59,17.79],["Dieu",17.98,18.18]],"ok":0.17},{"text":"On dit merci à Dieu !","t":18.38,"e":19.62,"w":[["On",18.38,18.46],["dit",18.5,18.6],["merci",18.66,19.1],["à",19.18,19.3],["Dieu",19.4,19.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"See where we dey now, on est bien calé","t":21.16,"e":23.1,"w":[["See",21.16,21.34],["where",21.4,21.58],["we",21.62,21.72],["dey",21.76,21.9],["now",21.94,22.06],["on",22.12,22.2],["est",22.24,22.32],["bien",22.38,22.58],["calé",22.66,23.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Hier on galérait, aujourd’hui ça va aller","t":25.4,"e":27.88,"w":[["Hier",25.4,25.56],["on",25.72,25.82],["galérait",25.86,26.38],["aujourd’hui",26.5,26.86],["ça",26.94,27.08],["va",27.14,27.28],["aller",27.44,27.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Many many wahala, but we still dey stand","t":29.68,"e":32.74,"w":[["Many",29.68,29.92],["many",29.98,30.24],["wahala",30.3,30.98],["but",31.18,31.32],["we",31.38,31.48],["still",31.58,31.98],["dey",32.04,32.18],["stand",32.3,32.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":